75,3,3,talk,Minako,,I concur. Candidate A is the only proposal that is compatible with our current infrastructure and staffing constraints. I cast my vote for Candidate A.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
