79,3,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm so happy we solved this mystery together! Candidate A is definitely the winner. I'm voting for Candidate A!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
