81,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll vote for Candidate A as well. I'm just relieved we found a project that is both sustainable and likely to succeed. Thank you for listening to me.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
